      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi @bungeman@google.com nona@google.com, pls take a look at revised version of this CL and let me know if it can be accepted.\n\nIn order to use a system font on SurfaceFlinger side i believe it is necessary to depend at least on `SkFontHost_FreeType` and `SkFontMgr_custom`. However that would mean that whenever a new font is used for the first time, it will need to be created on demand. I think this will cause unnecessary jank, therefore I\u0027ve chosen to use SkFontMgr_custom_directory api. That way a font manager providing access to system fonts will be created once at initialization time. Please let me know if my analysis is incorrect and a different way of using system fonts via Skia API exists.",
